  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EaP Trade Helpdesk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation of an EaP Trade Helpdesk to support trade exchanges between EaP countries and with the EU. The project will achieve the above through 6 outputs: * The EaP Trade Helpdesk portal, featuring a Market Information component and a Helpdesk component; * Step-by-step documentation guides, available through the portal, that detail the administrative procedures required to export selected products from the six EaP countries to the EU market; * Surveys in each country to identify the regulat</narrative>
  </description>
